{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04242","headline":"棹歌行 · 骆宾王","name":"棹歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"写月涂黄罢，凌波拾翠通。\n镜花摇芰日，衣麝入荷风。\n叶密舟难荡，莲疎浦易空。\n凤媒羞自托，鸳翼恨难穷。\n秋帐灯华翠，倡楼粉色红。\n相思无别曲，倂在棹歌中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}